<span class=\"italic\">want (to see)</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Pastimes Around the World", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "In North America, people like to travel as a hobby or pastime. They travel to different cities or to different countries. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "In Asia, people travel less to other countries. They prefer to travel between different cities.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "In Europe, people travel by train between different countries. It is easy to travel by train. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "What about in your country? Do people travel as a hobby?", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "How long does it take? ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "use this to ask how much time something takes", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\">Mia</span>: How long does the bus ride take?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Julian</span>: It takes 20 minutes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le02ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about plans.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "discounted ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a lower special price", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Are there any discounted tickets for the convention?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le02ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "stand ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a small, open store at a convention", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My work has a stand at the convention.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le02ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "excited ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to feel happy about something that is happening soon", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I am excited about Comic-Con!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le02ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to promise", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to tell someone that you will definitely do something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I promise to buy you lunch today.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le02ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn3le02ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Choose a place to visit with your friend.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make plans for how to get there (train, bus, etc.).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a short dialogue (5-6 lines).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice the dialogue with your partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue to plan for a day trip.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about what I prefer or want to do.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about modes of transportation.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}